## Original Content
A new Airbnb fee change is one of many costs and considerations that can affect whether running a short-term rental makes money.

## Summary
Airbnb has implemented a new fee change that is frustrating hosts who rent out their homes on the platform. The fee adjustment is one of several costs and considerations that can significantly impact whether operating a short-term rental is profitable.

## Key Points
- Airbnb has introduced a new fee change that hosts find frustrating
- Fee structures are a major factor in determining short-term rental profitability
- Prospective hosts should understand all costs and considerations before renting out their homes
- Running a short-term rental involves multiple financial factors beyond just booking revenue


